🔴 payments in shop is crash-looping.

What kwatch found
- The last run of payments-1/app ended OOMKilled, exit code 137.
- Memory climbed from 118Mi to 255Mi in 9 minutes.

Log, container app, previous run
  cache warm: 41882 entries
  cache warm: 96310 entries <@everyone>

Fix (changes the cluster)
Raise the memory limit to 384Mi, half again above the observed peak of 255Mi (changes the cluster)
  kubectl set resources deployment/payments -n shop -c app --limits=memory=384Mi
